<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Airing Cupboard Shelves Layout Guide</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Plan your airing cupboard from the bottom up. The cylinder and its pipes come first, then a warm shelf for airing, then everyday towels and bedding, and finally the top shelf for things you rarely need.</p>



